{# The body of a page-texts modal (`components/ManualPageText.html.twig`) —
   the part a Turbo Stream re-renders (ManualPreviewTurboStream): with the
   errors after an invalid submit, fresh after a save. It carries the rest of
   the form (the CSRF field), so the re-rendered body brings its own token.

   Params: page (ManualPage), form (FormView). #}
<div class="modal-body text-start" id="manual-page-text-form-{{ page.value }}">
    <p class="text-muted">
        Prázdné pole znamená výchozí text — ten je vidět jako nápověda v poli.
    </p>

    {{ form_errors(form) }}
    {{ form_row(form.title) }}
    {{ form_row(form.description) }}
    {{ form_rest(form) }}
</div>
